flowchart TB
    Target["Frozen theorem target<br/>assumptions + source packet + budget"] --> Governor["Hierarchical target governor<br/>owns statement + proof frontier"]
    Governor --> Split{"Are the next proof leaves<br/>mathematically independent?"}
    Split -->|no or unclear| H["Single routed worker<br/>diagnose one interface"]
    Split -. "yes, in matched trials" .-> P["Bounded parallel worker pool<br/>disjoint routes + disjoint files"]
    H --> Synthesis["Evidence-only synthesis<br/>certificate · blocker · reuse · cost"]
    P --> Synthesis
    Synthesis --> Review["Independent reviewer<br/>target fidelity + evidence audit"]
    Review --> Gate{"Deterministic gate<br/>focused compile + repository check"}
    Gate -->|accepted| Library["BanditRLlib declaration<br/>and synchronized explanation"]
    Gate -->|diagnostic| Log["Matched trial log<br/>certificate · blocker · reuse · cost"]
    Log --> Governor
    Library --> Memory["Reviewer-gated retrieval memory"]
